{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "feb78347a324f03d89af78d666f66a4090624ebbccee2e59809001e1b720b457", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのオーディションも佳境だな。\nさて、次の子は……）", "zh": "（39PROJECT的甄选也渐入佳境了。\n下一位是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "25023e72129eaf3a36bde81732dddee0e54f92a926bb15102669f0ca8a9e0a59", "ja": "姫の名前は、徳川まつりなのです。\nあなたが、まつりのプロデューサーさんなのです？", "zh": "公主名叫德川茉莉的唷。\n你就是茉莉的制作人先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "e20225472c2b7ad54526cf55de42fed7f7418546984c11159b44ce4114f90e08", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、\n姫って呼んでほしいのです。よろしくなのです！", "zh": "希望{$P$}先生\n也能叫茉莉公主，请多多指教的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7323d34657b9dd5b6020fbd7992269a2c6279aa38e947ffd0f02357f3bdd7b29", "ja": "ええっと……姫って、そういう設定なのかな？", "zh": "呃……你说公主，是一种角色设定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "ad9f4cb27b53826510a85b08197aa1f15317b3a68c616b9a04d814f3aeb0e0cb", "ja": "設定って、何のことなのです？　姫は、姫なのです。\n今日もお城から、白馬に乗って来たのです！", "zh": "你说的设定是指什么？公主就是公主的唷。\n公主今天也是从城堡骑白马过来的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0efa8ad47180eca14b1ce1f7f0b825f8b004491432d460ec34f7e72412a8a2a8", "ja": "そ、そう……。", "zh": "是、是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f59b1e3488354063f1d96e54c9f260b2c09d2c5ee940eb6013df4629cf4a3316", "ja": "（まあ、そういう設定なんだろう）", "zh": "（哎，总之大概就是那种设定吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "c8162bc342c26295ac19b0fc692ef21021311299f9186e16ec1cedd282ad3cc5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、姫に質問はないのです？\n今なら特別に、何でも答えてあげるのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你对公主没有疑问吗？\n现在特别开放发问的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0fa5b2abedb1800f7d0d932577af3fa6ad206b59c6269dc6d55989ee36a1c387", "ja": "あ、ありがとう。えーと……\nアイドルになろうと思ったきっかけは、なんですか？", "zh": "谢、谢谢。我想想……\n你想当偶像的契机是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "1316d18c0e6cf75872a6a9ddb7faa03ce233647e64f1fe6fd6dd50b555495ade", "ja": "ほ？　姫は、姫なのです。\nみんな、姫のことがだ～い好き！なのですよ？", "zh": "哦？公主就是公主的唷。\n大家都最～喜欢公主的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9d37439daad04f9699c36fc9c50d6d3212bc82e2de25d665cdcb18f3eae96f10", "ja": "そ、そうですか。\nそれじゃ、好きな食べ物はなんですか？", "zh": "是、是这样啊。\n那么你喜欢的食物是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "4959a253708a5014acceadb6cb68c6b238df16f010f63d6622bece8110274955", "ja": "{$P$}さん、いい質問なのです！\nまつりの好きな食べ物は、焼きマシュマロなのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，问得好的唷！\n茉莉喜欢的食物是烤棉花糖的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "2d6611095b316acf08b2f75a2db2fe780922cfa6a3fca023ee5bf7c331b5b6c2", "ja": "ふわふわのマシュマロに焦げ目がつくと、\nとびきり・らぶりー！なのです！", "zh": "要是把软绵绵的棉花糖烤上色，\n就会变得超迷人的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "955036fd994f0926083d5d442223ccd459b74cf2813c6ba528970624b9499933", "ja": "なるほど……。\nかわいいものが好きなんだね。", "zh": "原来如此……\n你喜欢可爱的东西是吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "50efa52b3fc4264599dfc0b2078adfc1d097453ac374ad50864931fbd70b541f", "ja": "そうなのです！\nマシュマロではないのです、焼きマシュマロなのです。", "zh": "就是这样的喔！\n不是棉花糖，而是烤棉花糖的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a07ae44f0da03cf910b1f5588b566170ce3a995b754193f3b5b11aedbb65cdec", "ja": "（捉えどころのない回答ばっかりだが……待てよ？）", "zh": "（都是一些让人难以捉摸的回答……等等！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "503df90fcae2a6ca44fb3315d79b0f1778f7936db625b0cf3352ea1b8c2c773f", "ja": "（お姫様で、焼きマシュマロが好き。\nかわいいものが、かわいいものを好き……）", "zh": "（公主喜欢烤棉花糖，\n可爱的人喜欢可爱的东西……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "67565b7fce2775fe88ff68f77a437b3a8a7e13e1864ae182170562f453e2269f", "ja": "かわいいもの＋かわいいもの＝最強にかわいい！\n……ってことかな？", "zh": "可爱的人+可爱的东西=可爱到不行！\n……你是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "046ba3600d9726985988f76c2689d9c62e8945a959216580bfc354fe529b99a9", "ja": "……！\n{$P$}さん、ぶらぼー！なのです！", "zh": "……！\n{$P$}先生，你太棒了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "b94103d495d15f14ea64dded64e0fd0711b600cc5583dfc14bfd31efbe1def20", "ja": "まつりは焼きマシュマロみたいな、\nふわふわでらぶりー！になりたいのです。", "zh": "茉莉想变得跟烤棉花糖一样，\n软绵绵又迷人的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "bd6f5609c4f8325f9b741d6788cc16bd9c1443853d2df34a7e018aaa5feedb95", "ja": "まつりを、とびきり・びゅーてぃほー！にできるのは、\nきっと{$P$}さんだけなのですー！", "zh": "能让茉莉变得超～美丽的人！\n肯定只有{$P$}先生了喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3d812340c57204126cb093a5adb99ebdd60bff8946979c3e4d81b435b52bab49", "ja": "（なんとなくこの子の特徴がわかってきたぞ。\n可愛い系お姫様アイドル……うん、面白そうだ！）", "zh": "（我开始掌握到她的特色了。\n可爱型的公主偶像……嗯，感觉很有趣！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_1022", "source_sha256": "82ba7c0d8c36a1f2eea44a72c4f98c86ac32928739faf770b0e6dad375a952d7", "ja": "合格だ！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ce9254941f0d300d1bb4e9d7e89377bdaa7296a0d192373e709430f4631c1da4", "ja": "徳川まつりさん、合格だ！\n俺と一緒にトップアイドルを目指そう！", "zh": "德川茉莉小姐，你被录取了！\n和我一起以顶尖偶像为目标努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_2001_021mat", "source_sha256": "01ea64a7d6a6d41517e5829867c38312ae1d68d330498fdae0ef50669a5ae13a", "ja": "はいほー！\nまつり姫の物語が、今日から始まるのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho！\n茉莉公主的故事就从今天开始了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_2002_021mat", "source_sha256": "a97e98c2dafd4266641b8574c6ec1bdd46a69bc483f88257101a8ad6646f0d0f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nこれからよろしく、なのです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n今后请多多指教了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_2003_021mat", "source_sha256": "72c1f36652cb811f7dc72f84c9b9729c8244dcd7aed6b8d728ec6a89317a9b74", "ja": "それから、姫のことは「姫」か「まつり」と\n呼んでほしいのです。……ね？", "zh": "还有，希望你能称呼公主为「公主」或「茉莉」的喔。\n……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "3ee69da0e85523caf9f92efca1c3ad6274de8330f9216756dd01917ddae287a0", "ja": "わかった。\nこちらこそよろしく、まつり！", "zh": "我知道了。\n我也要请你多多指教，茉莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "47063ce6de4b01e59f79b2b68aa33b276dce46007352498d0d0d790079da3dbe", "ja": "（個性的で魅力的な子だ。\nしっかりプロデュースしてあげよう！）", "zh": "（她真是兼具个性与魅力。\n我要好好地培育她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
